  "lyrics": {
    "rawText": "\nSeventeen sparks in a quiet room  \nTiny flares in measured bloom  \nShuffle the deck, let the table decide  \nWhich hidden colors step outside  \n\nEach small seed in a different key  \nLeaning toward possibility  \nNot every path is meant to stay  \nSome fade soft, some find their way  \n\nLet them rise, let them blend  \nWatch the broken edges mend  \nFrom scattered codes we comprehend  \nNew seeds turning round again  \n\nCount the pulse that shifts beneath  \nFeel the pattern show its teeth  \nSilence holds the in-between  \nWhere the wild becomes serene  \n\nLet them rise, let them blend  \nWatch the broken edges mend  \nFrom scattered codes we comprehend  \nNew seeds turning round again  \n\nRound again  \n"
  },
